        <headline>Small Craft Advisory issued September 25 at 1:46PM EDT until September 26 at 8:00PM EDT by NWS Jacksonville FL</headline>
        <description>* WHAT...North winds 10 to 20 kt with gusts up to 25 kt and seas
6 to 11 ft.

* WHERE...Waters from Altamaha Sound GA to Fernandina Beach FL
from 20 to 60 NM.

* WHEN...Until 8 PM EDT Saturday.

* IMPACTS...Conditions will be hazardous to small craft.
</description>
        <instruction>Inexperienced mariners, especially those operating smaller
vessels, should avoid navigating in hazardous conditions.</instruction>
